  "_notes": [
    "settings.publicNet, settings.volumeMounts and settings.workspaceSize are k8s-only \u2014 the local DockerDeployer ignores them, so the row is the production blob verbatim with the understanding that some keys are no-ops locally.",
    "hot_count / cold_count / max_concurrent_deployments are written to svc_configs verbatim by seed.sh. Currently 1/1/2 \u2014 a leaner local pool than production's 2/2/2.",
    "config_hash is left blank \u2014 pool-manager recomputes it on next reconcile.",
    "configs is an array \u2014 seed.sh iterates and upserts each row. 'kairo-ephemeral' is the per-application ephemeral profile; same blob minus volumeMounts/workspaceSize (no PVC, see jumbo migration 000035).",
    "settings.image is localized to a clode-stack/* tag so pool-manager's DockerDeployer uses the locally-built image (imagePullPolicy IfNotPresent \u2014 never a registry pull). kairo rows get 'clode-stack/benji:latest' (built by `up.sh --agent`); the aramb-browser row gets 'clode-stack/brave-head:latest' (built by `up.sh --browser`). seed.sh overrides these per service_type from BENJI_IMAGE / BROWSER_IMAGE when the corresponding build flag ran.",
    "aramb-browser is the brave-head (agent-base-docker/brave-headed) pool ikki drives via IKKI_CONNECT; production image is bongcs/brave-headed:sha-*, imagePullPolicy Always."
  ],
